# UI-WINDOW-1 fix round R4: before the first founding the local player owns no city and the
# status bar's materials and residents are hidden (hud_idle_running shows none; docs/re/ui.md
# 5.2). The ship-start opening on lan5 begins with no city.
# Launch: --ship-start <lan5-ship-a.json> --seat 0 --construction-menu on --layout data/ui
resize 1024 768
wait frames 30
expect fact hud.counters == hidden
expect fact hud.counters.city == none
screenshot counters_before_founding
quit
